    {
      "names": {
        "en": "Sign PDF",
        "zh-Hans": "PDF 手写签名"
      },
      "summaries": {
        "en": "Create a safe PDF copy and open it in Preview for handwritten signing.",
        "zh-Hans": "创建 PDF 副本并在“预览”中打开，用触控板或 iPhone 手写签名。"
      },
      "descriptions": {
        "en": "Drop a single PDF onto NotchAny. The action creates a non-destructive copy next to the original and opens the copy in macOS Preview. Use Preview's Markup > Signature tool with a trackpad, camera, or iPhone/iPad, then save normally.\n\nExisting files are never overwritten. If a signature copy already exists, the action creates a numbered copy automatically.",
        "zh-Hans": "将单个 PDF 拖入 NotchAny。动作会在原文件旁创建一份不覆盖原件的副本，并使用 macOS“预览”打开。通过“标记”>“签名”，可使用触控板、摄像头或 iPhone/iPad 创建手写签名，完成后正常保存。\n\n动作不会覆盖已有文件；如果签名副本已经存在，会自动创建带序号的新副本。"
      },
